Package: ppol6818
Title: Course Setup and AI Agent Launcher for PPOL 6818
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Benjamin", "Daniels", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "bd581@georgetown.edu")
Description: Checks a student's sign-ins for GitHub, Codex, KoboToolbox and
    IPUMS, sends the student to the right sign-up or key page when one is
    missing, connects the course AI agents to KoboToolbox and to the student's
    RStudio session, and opens the agent inside RStudio.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite, rstudioapi, curl, ipumsr, mcptools, ellmer
